  "contents": [{
    "heading": "overview",
    "content": "This breaking change is mainly made to address problems of generateFiles() function."
  }, {
    "heading": "overview",
    "content": "Previously, it was a simple function to generate multiple MDX files/pages from your OpenAPI schema, same as every docs generator.\nWe tested it on public OpenAPI schemas such as Unkey, Vercel and examples from Scalar and Swagger's Museum schema."
  }, {
    "heading": "overview",
    "content": "Since these schemas were written for different docs solutions, or even their custom ones.\nWe made generateFiles() too complicated to be capable of producing best results for various schema styles, and it's even harder to customise the generated file paths of API docs."
  }, {
    "heading": "overview",
    "content": "This update also include:"
  }, {
    "heading": "overview",
    "content": "Better UI for schema & playground body input"
  }, {
    "heading": "overview",
    "content": "Improved type-safety for generateFiles()"
  }, {
    "heading": "breaking-changes",
    "content": "The algorithm for generating file paths is changed:"
  }, {
    "heading": "breaking-changes",
    "content": "meta.json will no longer be generated, add as your wanted."
  }, {
    "heading": "breaking-changes",
    "content": "per: operation: The generated path will be identical to your operation id. If not defined, it takes your endpoint path instead."
  }, {
    "heading": "group-by",
    "content": "The behaviour of groupBy API is also changed."
  }, {
    "heading": "group-by",
    "content": "value"
  }, {
    "heading": "group-by",
    "content": "output"
  }, {
    "heading": "group-by",
    "content": "tag"
  }, {
    "heading": "group-by",
    "content": "{tag}/{operationId ?? endpoint_path}.mdx"
  }, {
    "heading": "group-by",
    "content": "route"
  }, {
    "heading": "group-by",
    "content": "{endpoint_path}/{method}.mdx (ignores name option)"
  }, {
    "heading": "group-by",
    "content": "none"
  }, {
    "heading": "group-by",
    "content": "{operationId ?? endpoint_path}.mdx (default)"
  }, {
    "heading": "customise-output",
    "content": "The usage of name option is renewed, it can be used to customise the output path of files."
  }, {
    "heading": "migration",
    "content": "You can start using the latest algorithm, or keep the current behaviour with:"
  }, {
    "heading": "migration",
